WEBVTT

00:11:27.045 --> 00:11:30.600
that conflates desire with property rights,

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:33.365
generates shame and confusion

00:11:33.365 --> 00:11:36.200
in place of understanding and empathy.

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:38.916
It's time we moved beyond Mars and Venus,

00:11:38.916 --> 00:11:40.646
because the truth is

00:11:40.646 --> 00:11:41.983
that men are from Africa

00:11:41.983 --> 00:11:43.979
and women are from Africa.

00:11:43.979 --> 00:11:45.924
Thank you.

00:11:45.924 --> 00:11:51.383
(Applause)

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:57.024
Chris Anderson: Thank you.
Christopher Ryan: Thank you.

00:11:57.024 --> 00:11:58.766
CA: So a question.

00:11:58.766 --> 00:12:02.665
It's so perplexing, trying to use arguments